id: pm-yrio0m
title: CI assurance receipts must explicitly request complete evidence beyond interactive output ceilings
description: The pull-request assurance step exits 2 when its truthful bounded receipt exceeds the interactive default. CI must request unbounded audit evidence explicitly while retaining normal agent ceilings and all assertion verdicts.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
