author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "All three actual CI assurance invocations request complete JSON evidence, retain trigger ci and dry-run, and block on failing assertion verdicts. Contract regression rejects restoring an interactive ceiling."
parent: pm-u9d0
repro_steps: "PR 1234 run 34573336591 Gates (static): Run tracker assurance gates emitted requested_budget_infeasible at 6001 estimated tokens against the 6000 default and exited 2."
resolution: Add explicit unbounded JSON output to the three CI assurance invocations and enforce their complete fail-closed workflow contract.
expected_result: CI assurance retains every assertion verdict without failing because an interactive diagnostic ceiling is exceeded.
actual_result: The previous workflow fails the new regression; fixed workflow passes 14 tests and all 52 real assurance assertions with complete JSON output.
